---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy — Free LinkedIn Text Formatter"
  description="Read our Privacy Policy. We respect your privacy: 100% client-side text formatting with zero data collection, zero tracking cookies, and no registration required."
>
  <section class="py-12 md:py-16 bg-canvas">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      {/* Header */}
      <div class="mb-10 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline px-3 py-1 rounded-md uppercase tracking-wider">
          Legal & Privacy
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mt-3">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-body text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono mt-2">
          Last updated: August 18, 2026 • 100% Client-Side Processing
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Policy Content */}
      <div class="space-y-8 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed font-sans">
        
        <div class="bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">Our Privacy Promise</h2>
          <p>
            At <strong>Free LinkedIn Text Formatter</strong> (`freelinkedintextformatter.com`), we believe your privacy is a fundamental right. Our web application is engineered to operate <strong>100% client-side inside your browser</strong>. We do not collect, store, transmit, or monetize your post drafts, personal information, or usage history.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">1. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            Because our formatting engine runs entirely within your browser's JavaScript runtime environment:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs text-body pl-2">
            <li><strong>No Text Draft Logging:</strong> Any text you type, paste, or format into the editor box stays strictly on your local device. It is never uploaded to any remote server or database.</li>
            <li><strong>No User Account Data:</strong> We do not offer logins or account registration. No names, email addresses, or passwords are ever requested or saved.</li>
            <li><strong>No Tracking Cookies:</strong> We do not place invasive advertising or behavioral tracking cookies on your browser.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">2. Local Storage Usage</h2>
          <p>
            We use your browser's native <code>localStorage</code> API solely to store your visual theme preference (e.g., Light Mode vs Dark Mode). This preference is stored locally on your device under the key <code>theme</code> and is never transmitted to us or any third party.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">3. Third-Party Services & External Links</h2>
          <p>
            Our website does not load external tracking scripts or advertising networks. If you follow links from our website to external platforms (such as LinkedIn, Instagram, or Facebook), those external services operate under their own independent privacy policies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">4. Trademark Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            "LinkedIn" is a registered trademark of LinkedIn Corporation. This web tool is an independent utility and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by LinkedIn Corporation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">5. Contact Us Regarding Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions or feedback regarding our privacy practices, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 p-4 bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-ink">
            Email: <a href="mailto:support@freelinkedintextformatter.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">support@freelinkedintextformatter.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
